&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Async] Working assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[60m] &lt;a href=&quot;https://app.notion.com/p/sourcegraph/Resources-for-Candidates-Engineering-Interview-Process-c37a70dea5794085bee0c0818c9ef0b3?source=copy_link#3eca8e11265880d0bf48d79154ffdf00&quot;&gt;Assignment Walkthrough + Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
