&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hvcv8w&quot; data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1650&quot;&gt;You enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams, communicating recommendations to clients, and solving complex product challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18k4el5&quot; data-start=&quot;1651&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;You thrive in a remote, consulting environment where you can manage multiple client engagements, take ownership, and adapt quickly to new products and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
