job_detail_fetch.content:
&lt;p&gt;Hello, I’m Ricci, Sales Manager at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; in EMEA! We&#39;re expanding our sales team in the &lt;strong&gt;United Kingdom and Ireland&lt;/strong&gt; and seeking motivated and successful Account Executives at the Mid-Market level to join us! This role offers a unique opportunity to take your sales career to the next level, with potential for upward mobility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you’ll represent&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to prospective customers and drive growth within key market segments. This is a full-cycle sales role (prospect, demo, close), where you&#39;ll be fielding both inbound and outbound demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 9,000 companies — from scrappy startups to global brands — use our platform to send billions of emails, push notifications, in-app messages, and SMS every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;powers automated communication that people actually want to receive. We help teams send smarter, more relevant messages using real-time behavioral data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Development and Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and manage a pipeline through self-sourced leads and SDR-supported leads to drive new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Sales Execution&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the entire sales process from prospecting and discovery through demo and closing for deals typically under $50,000 ACV, focusing solely on new business acquisition within targeted accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Needs Analysis and Solution Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Conduct discovery calls to understand customer business challenges and goals. Position&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&#39;s solutions to meet these needs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration and Cross-Functional Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the SDR team for lead quality feedback and collaborate with Customer Success and Technical Support for a smooth hand-off post-sale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking and Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;: Own and report on individual sales metrics, including pipeline status and progress towards targets, to support informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Volume Prospecting&lt;/strong&gt;: Engage in consistent cold and warm outreach to build and maintain a healthy top-of-funnel pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Relationship Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Nurture relationships within mid-sized accounts to uncover business needs and drive growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;2+ years of experience in full-cycle B2B SaaS or MarTech sales, handling mid-market accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; We are currently hiring for positions based in the UK and Ireland. Candidates must be located in one of these regions to be considered for the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B SaaS or MarTech Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven success in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;new customer acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and closing deals within the B2B SaaS space, preferably MarTech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Methodology&lt;/strong&gt;: Familiarity with MEDDPICC or a similar framework that supports consultative selling and discovery to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a professional and engaging presence to build rapport with new prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong ability to identify customer business needs and position relevant solutions effectively to drive acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Focus&lt;/strong&gt;: Primarily handles mid-market accounts with shorter sales cycles and lower ACV deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Works closely with our SDR team for lead generation, with a balance between inbound and self-sourced opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in transparency. We are offering a compensation package of $95,000 base + $95,000 variable for a total $190,000 OTE USD (or equivalent in local currency), subject to market rate adjustment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know our people are what make us great, and we’re committed to taking great care of them. Our inclusive benefits package supports your well-being and growth, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100% coverage of medical, dental, vision, mental health, and supplemental insurance premiums for you and your family&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave, unlimited PTO&lt;/strong&gt;, stipends for remote work and wellness, a professional development budget, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/careers#:~:text=our%20collective%20success.-,BENEFITS,-Our%C2%A0&quot;&gt;See full benefits here →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No gotchas, no trick questions - just a clear, human process designed to help both of us make an informed decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute video call with Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;45-minute video call with Hiring Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;60-minute Mock Call w/ Hiring Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All final candidates will be asked to complete a background check and employment verifications as part of our pre-employment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;recognizes the stifling impact of systemic injustice on diverse communities. We commit to using our influence to increase inclusion and equity within the tech industry. We strive to build an inclusive team culture, implement bias-free hiring practices, and develop community partnerships to expand our global impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zoom is the only video conference platform that we use, virtual interviews will be conducted using the video capability (i.e., not via the chat), and offers will be extended in writing on official &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; letterhead. Please be vigilant in all of your job search activity, and if you have any questions please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:jobs@customer.io&quot;&gt;jobs@customer.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about why you should&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/about/&quot;&gt;come work with us!&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are passionate about our core values of Empathy, Transparency, Responsibility, and Awkwardness and are looking for new coworkers to share and build that passion!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;About&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://customer.io/&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 8,000 companies — from scrappy startups to global brands — use our platform to send billions of emails, push notifications, in-app messages, and SMS every day. &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; powers automated communication that people actually want to receive. We help teams send smarter, more relevant messages using real-time behavioral data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Sales Manager to build and lead a &lt;strong&gt;new team of 8 Account Executives&lt;/strong&gt; in our Mid-Market organization. You&#39;ll join a group of managers already running this motion successfully, but the team you lead is yours to stand up and shape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a frontline leadership role. Your job is to translate our go-to-market strategy into consistent team execution: you&#39;ll coach reps, inspect deals, drive forecast accuracy, and create the structure that allows strong performance to repeat quarter after quarter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach Account Executives to consistently meet or exceed quota and grow into their next role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run focused 1:1s built around deal quality, skill development, and real accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ramp new reps quickly and address performance gaps early, before they compound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a team culture rooted in ownership, collaboration, and high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive pipeline health and forecast accuracy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead weekly pipeline and forecast reviews focused on deal progression, qualification rigor, and clear next steps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharpen predictability through disciplined inspection and clean CRM hygiene across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain healthy pipeline coverage and get ahead of creation gaps before they become quarter-enders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce structured, rep-owned outbound tied to measurable standards and pipeline outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use metrics and experimentation to make outbound sharper over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use metric review and experimentation to improve outbound effectiveness over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support high-quality deal execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach reps to run well-qualified mid-market opportunities from discovery through close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate deal strategy with stronger positioning, cleaner value articulation, confident executive-level communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reps navigate pricing, stakeholder alignment, and procurement without losing momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot patterns in stalled deals and raise the whole team&#39;s execution maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Sales Ops, Marketing, and Solutions Architects to unblock deals and improve how the team executes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring frontline feedback on messaging, territory design, and enablement back to the people who own it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot and operationalize new GTM initiatives inside your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7–10 years in sales&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;3–5+ years managing quota-carrying reps&lt;/strong&gt; - ideally in Marketing Technology or SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading successful mid-market or high-velocity sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely strong at pipeline inspection and forecasting - you can smell a soft deal from a mile away&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced coaching outbound pipeline generation in evolving sales motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating inside a structured qualification framework like MEDDICC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, direct communicator who holds a high bar without needing to raise their voice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective cross-functionally in a collaborative, fast-moving, growth-stage environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in transparency. Compensation for this role is $140,000 base + $140,000 variable = $280,000 OTE (or equivalent in local currency) depending on experience and subject to market rate adjustment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We know our people are what make us great, and we’re committed to taking great care of them. Our inclusive benefits package supports your well-being and growth, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100% coverage of medical, dental, vision, mental health, and supplemental insurance premiums for you and your family&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave, unlimited PTO&lt;/strong&gt;, stipends for remote work and wellness, a professional development budget, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/careers#:~:text=our%20collective%20success.-,BENEFITS,-Our%C2%A0&quot;&gt;See full benefits here →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No gotchas, no trick questions - just a clear, human process designed to help both of us make an informed decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute conversation with a Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;45-minute conversation with the Hiring Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1:1 conversations with cross-functional partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One week to complete a take-home assignment, followed by a 60-minute review call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All final candidates will be asked to complete a background check and employment verifications as part of our pre-employment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; recognizes the stifling impact of systemic injustice on diverse communities. We commit to using our influence to increase inclusion and equity within the tech industry. We strive to build an inclusive team culture, implement bias-free hiring practices, and develop community partnerships to expand our global impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zoom is the only video conference platform that we use, virtual interviews will be conducted using the video capability (i.e., not via the chat), and offers will be extended in writing on official &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; letterhead. Please be vigilant in all of your job search activity, and if you have any questions please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:jobs@customer.io&quot;&gt;jobs@customer.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Join us!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about why you should&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://customer.io/about/&quot;&gt;come work with us!&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe in empathy, transparency, responsibility, and, yes, a little awkwardness. If you’re excited by what you read — apply now.&lt;/p&gt;
