&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to build a partnership ecosystem around a solution that every business needs - automated cloud native management. During the current recessionary and inflationary environment, companies are frantically looking for ways to reduce expenses. Few expenses are more burdensome than cloud costs. Cast AI has the perfect software solution, cutting clients&#39; cloud bills in half or more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Partner Account Manager who is willing to turn the world upside down to make Cast AI the default cloud automation solution. With an objective, ROI-driven sale and a straightforward integration, Cast AI is the perfect opportunity for the right candidate to take a lifestyle-changing, rewarding, and exciting opportunity and help us build our partnership landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is primarily focused on EMEA North,with room to&amp;nbsp; expand into Central, with room to grow into wider EMEA over time. You&#39;ll be building the partner ecosystem for the region almost from the ground up - while the team and relationships already exist, this is very much a hunter role, focused on creating new go-to-market motion through the right partners.&lt;/p&gt;
