&lt;li&gt;Background at a digital-native company, startup, or ISV - someone who has seen a partner ecosystem being built and wants to build one themselves, rather than someone coming from a large enterprise environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to DevOps/Engineering personas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunger for a fast-moving, agile, and scaling work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hard-working, independent, and self-driven work ethic - open to learning and feedback, yet reliable and independent in execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player, natural &amp;amp; relationship-first collaborator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to build a partner ecosystem from the bottom up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love of process, sales, wins, and challenges - driven by overcoming obstacles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent presentation skills and ability to create engagement in a meeting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
