&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a ground-floor build, not a maintenance job. The foundation is real - a defined partner tiering model, a growing partner base, and two Partner Managers already running the MSP and VAR tiers day-to-day. What&#39;s missing is the person who turns that foundation into a repeatable, scaling engine: recruiting and activating the partners that actually move revenue, standing up the GSI motion from scratch, and making partner-sourced pipeline a forecastable line in Cast AI&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll manage and grow the PAM team, but you&#39;ll also carry your own strategic relationships - particularly at the GSI level - and be the person the Director of Partnerships and sales leadership turn to for how the channel is performing and where it&#39;s headed. As Cast AI scales past unicorn status, this is a genuine build-and-own mandate, not an inherited process to maintain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record building or scaling a multi-tier partner programme (MSP, VAR, GSI, or similar) at a high-growth SaaS or cloud infrastructure company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with GSIs - you know how to structure and activate a relationship with a systems integrator, not just a reseller&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing a team of PAMs or a channel team - hiring, coaching, and performance-managing multiple direct reports, with the judgment to know when to let them run and when to get involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive presence - able to represent Cast AI credibly with senior partner stakeholders and with internal sales/exec leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable selling to and through DevOps, Platform Engineering, and FinOps personas; working familiarity with AWS, GCP, and Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with the mechanics of a channel programme: deal registration, joint account planning, QBRs, co-sell motions, partner incentives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a digital-native company, startup, or ISV preferred - someone who has scaled a channel function before, not just inherited one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role requires the candidate to be based in the U.S. Eastern or Central time zone to support close collaboration with our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have full ownership of the Cast AI Channel Program - strategy, structure, and results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The GSI motion, built from the ground up - recruitment, executive relationship-building, and joint go-to-market planning with systems integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A scaled strategy for MSPs and Cloud Consultants that turns the tier into its own revenue stream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The PAM team, managed directly across territories, with room to hire and develop as the function grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruitment, onboarding, and activation across all three tiers, with direct focus on the top strategic MSP and VAR targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The operating cadence across the programme - QBRs, joint account planning, partner advisory input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program infrastructure - tiering criteria, incentive structures, deal registration process, enablement and certification content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional alignment with Sales, SEs, Marketing, Product, Finance, and Legal to keep channel strategy tied to company priorities&lt;/li&gt;
