&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design comparisons that survive scrutiny.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Measure Kimchi against incumbent tooling on accuracy, cost per run, and developer experience, and make the numbers land for both engineers and executive buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
