&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1328&quot; data-local-id=&quot;491bedce7258&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Turn ambiguity into product direction.&lt;/strong&gt; Take broad or poorly understood opportunities and structure them into clear problems, hypotheses, assumptions, and experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
