&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1646&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f06b45d235f5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Validate before scaling.&lt;/strong&gt; Find the fastest way to test whether a problem matters and whether our proposed solution creates meaningful value. Be equally comfortable investing further or killing an idea when the evidence says we should.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1883&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e526464a71cc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Make hard prioritization decisions.&lt;/strong&gt; There will always be more interesting opportunities than we can pursue. You’ll decide what deserves attention now, what can wait, and what we should deliberately not build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2095&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3d816907e8f6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Work directly with customers.&lt;/strong&gt; Run discovery, observe workflows, understand underlying motivations and constraints, and distinguish individual requests from broader problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2272&quot; data-local-id=&quot;542f2d7f75d0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner deeply with engineering and design.&lt;/strong&gt; Shape solutions collaboratively. Understand enough of the technology to explore possibilities and trade-offs with strong technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2457&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9614e540aabc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Define what success means.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish the customer and business outcomes we expect, determine how to measure them, and use evidence to guide subsequent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2622&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed080bcc071e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive adoption, not just launches.&lt;/strong&gt; Stay accountable after something ships. Understand whether customers are discovering it, using it repeatedly, getting value from it, and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2802&quot; data-local-id=&quot;485c3aa457ee&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Communicate clearly.&lt;/strong&gt; Write concise product narratives, one-pagers, PRDs, and decision documents that make complex problems understandable and align teams around what matters and why. We are a distributed team, so exceptional writing skills are essential for every member.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3077&quot; data-local-id=&quot;66d14cd89bfb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Help shape Kimchi itself.&lt;/strong&gt; This is still a rapidly evolving product and organization. You’ll influence not only individual features, but how we think about the product, our customers, and the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a flexible, remote-first global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of Kubernetes technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;356&quot;&gt;Equity options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;451&quot;&gt;Get quick feedback with a fast-paced workflow. Most feature projects are completed in 1 to 4 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;554&quot;&gt;Spend 10% of your work time on personal projects or self-improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;628&quot;&gt;Learning budget for professional and personal development - including access to international conferences and courses that elevate your skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;775&quot;&gt;Annual hackathon to spark new ideas and strengthen team bonds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;841&quot;&gt;Team-building budget and company events to connect with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Equipment budget to ensure you have everything you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Extra days off to help maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
