&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;775&quot;&gt;Annual hackathon to spark new ideas and strengthen team bonds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;841&quot;&gt;Team-building budget and company events to connect with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Equipment budget to ensure you have everything you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Extra days off to help maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home assignment&lt;/li&gt;
