&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Requirement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please include a portfolio with your application that highlights your design expertise and experience delivering work for SaaS platforms, data visualization tools, or similar data-heavy applications. This helps us understand your design capabilities and how you approach complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
