&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;b1bd07f94795&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve built or operated trust-critical systems at scale - authentication/authorization, billing, or financial/accounting-adjacent data, where being wrong has real consequences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;40c0c59b7220&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Good understanding of API design best practices - versioning, backward compatibility, auth, idempotency, async patterns, and similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;f879fb86c8c6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong debugging, optimization, and performance-tuning skills – including query profiling, index design, and database performance tuning beyond ORM usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;aac472a85602&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience operating and optimizing systems under high load - you know how to find and fix the bottleneck, not just add more resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;5488677db5af&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Kubernetes - you understand the core concepts (pods, services, deployments) and have deployed or debugged something on a cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;ef275fe12393&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;2833b357-4567-4c85-9d68-e2a290a3d68c&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;2833b357-4567-4c85-9d68-e2a290a3d68c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;Experience with AI coding agents and agentic development workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;58ec06d8d745&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve personally driven a complex project end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
